<title>USA: Gentex approves share repurchase.</title>
<headline>Gentex approves share repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>ZEELAND, Mich. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gentex Corp, a manufacturer of automotive accessory and fire protection products, said Thursday its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to one million shares of common stock.  </p>
<p>Under the program, the company may, from time to time, purchase shares based on a number of factors, including market conditions, available cash, the market price of the stock and other factors as the company deems appropriate, Gentex said.</p>
<p>The company may discontinue purchases of its stock at any time that management determines additional purchases are not warranted. Shares repurchased under this program may be made in either in open market or negotiated private transactions, the company said.</p>
<p>Gentex shares rose 3/4 to 19-3/8 Thursday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
